{
  "name": "Viper's Venom",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you damage a creature with a weapon affected by your Rite of the Viper, it has to make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Hemocraft save DC. You can force a creature to make this Saving Throw only once per turn.</p><p>On a failure, a target is Poisoned for 1 minute. It can repeat the Saving Throw at the end of each of its turn, ending the effect on a success.</p>",
